@startuml
title D-05 Continuity Terminal Activation and Restricted Operation Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Supervisor
actor Cashier
participant "Continuity Terminal\n(disabled by default)" as Terminal
participant "Operator Console /\nApproved Operations Workflow" as Console
participant "Central PMS" as Central
database "Session Projection /\nApproved Continuity Source" as Projection
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate

Supervisor -> Console : approve BCP / degraded activation
Console -> Terminal : activation context,\nincident and policy controls
Cashier -> Terminal : scan / enter ticket or card
Terminal -> Central : degraded lookup request
Central -> Projection : check freshness and ambiguity

alt safe under approved degraded policy
  Central --> Terminal : payable basis from approved source
  Terminal -> Central : payment workflow where allowed
  Central -> POS : fiscal issuance where available and allowed
  POS --> Central : fiscal status
  Central -> Gate : ExitAuthorization if eligible
  Central --> Terminal : status for customer instruction
else unsafe or insufficient
  Central --> Terminal : fail closed / supervisor review
  Terminal -> Console : manual review context
end

note over Terminal
Discount handling is restricted.
If entitlement, evidence, policy basis,
projection freshness, or payable basis is unsafe,
the terminal fails closed or routes to review.
end note

@enduml
